        "## Task 8: Standardize Numerical Features\n",
        "\n",
        "Identify the numerical predictors that need to be standardized.\n",
        "\n",
        "Use the following standardization equation:\n",
        "\n",
        "\\[\n",
        "z = ($x$-$\\mu$)/$\\sigma$\n",
        "\\]\n",
        "\n",
        "where:\n",
        "\n",
